pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: deco-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 58, 4, 36]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [96, 50, 1100, 48]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>平台定位：去中心化智能协同服务平台</p>
  - elementId: left-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 130, 550, 260]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$card"
  - elementId: left-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [110, 160, 36, 36]
    iconName: "fas:bolt"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: left-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [160, 160, 440, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>定位一：去中心化智能维护协作平台</p>
  - elementId: left-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [110, 210, 490, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>提供"需求识别—分布式排产—就近制造—远程交付"全流程线上闭环服务</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">制造数据不出域，工艺参数按需受控流转</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">面向区域保障节点、制造产能集群提供区块链存证、数字孪生质检、智能合约调度</p>
  - elementId: right-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [650, 130, 550, 260]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$card"
  - elementId: right-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [680, 160, 36, 36]
    iconName: "fas:network-wired"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: right-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [730, 160, 440, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>定位二：特种装备维护资源协同网</p>
  - elementId: right-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 210, 490, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>维护需求、制造产能、备件库存、质量数据等资源目录融合共享与智能寻址</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">各节点具备全网资源动态调度能力</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">构建全寿命周期可追溯、平战结合的装备保障新体系</p>
  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 420, 1120, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}
  - elementId: role-title
